data: {"id": "9abf9d5f12ae4c47-thinking-parallel_evidence-668", "run_id": "9abf9d5f12ae4c47", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：workload-68c557d875-gtzc8 当前 **Pending**，`nodeName: None`，`PodScheduled=False`\n2. **调度事件**：反复出现 **FailedScheduling**，完整文本：`\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"`\n3. **Pod 调度约束**：`nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}` — 要求节点必须有标签 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`\n4. **节点标签**：集群 3 个节点（master、node1、node2）均为 **Ready**，但它们的标签中**均不含 `aiops.lab/unavailable`**（只有标准的 `kubernetes.io/*`、`node-role.kubernetes.io/*`、`metax-tech.com/gpu.in", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789036895018, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

